<title>USA: Norstan names Richard as president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Norstan names Richard as president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH, Minn. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norstan Inc said Tuesday it had appointed David Richard to the position of chief executive officer and president, effective May 1.</p>
<p>It said Paul Baszucki, co-chairman, will continue as chairman.</p>
<p>Company founder Sidney Cohen, previously co-chairman and CEO, will become chairman emeritus.</p>
<p>The president's position is newly created.  </p>
<p>Richard was with International Business Machines Corp for 30 years in a variety of executive positions.</p>
<p>Norstan provides integrated voice, video and data technology.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
